# This repo preserves the SYSTEM: skills, hooks and settings (.claude/), tools/, docs/, CLAUDE.md, and for each
# project what a rebuild and a review need: README.md, STATE.md, NEXT_SESSION.md, macros/**/*.py, the traced
# vectors, its docs/ scripts and tables, and the audit records (regions, reports, baseline sweeps).
# Sources (photos, CT scans, sketches, downloaded meshes) and generated output (stl/, step/, renders/) stay on
# disk only (user decision 2026-09-25); sources/ needs its own backup. Widened 2026-11-11, after a disk format
# lost every untracked input and gate. See docs/architecture.md, "What the repo tracks".

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
# Local interpreter (docs/system.md, "Python environment")
/.venv/

# Inputs: never committed (includes raw, not de-identified CT panes and multi-GB downloaded meshes)
/sources/
/references/

# Projects: allowlist. Everything is ignored except the entries below.
/projects/**
!/projects/**/
!/projects/**/README.md
!/projects/**/STATE.md
!/projects/**/NEXT_SESSION.md
!/projects/**/macros/**/*.py
# traced outlines the macros import (small text files)
!/projects/**/vectors/**/*.dxf
!/projects/**/vectors/**/*.svg
# check scripts and measurement tables (docs/mechanism_sizing.py, docs/MEASUREMENTS.md)
!/projects/**/docs/*.py
!/projects/**/docs/*.md
# audit records: sweep regions, plans/registers/reports, the baseline sweep of each bake
!/projects/**/audit/regions.json
!/projects/**/audit/**/*.md
!/projects/**/audit/**/sweep_*.json
# ...but never rejected attempts (deleted on explicit user rejection, lesson recorded in the README;
# see docs/attempts.md)
/projects/**/attempts/

# Large working files, anywhere
*.npy
*.blend
*.blend1

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Temporary / scratchpad
/tmp/
